{"3351550": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Alien Grounds", "steam_appid": 3351550, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alien Grounds is a fast sci-fi action FPS built around arena shooter combat against relentless enemy hordes - a clean, high-speed loop of short runs, escalating pressure, and mastery. It blends boomer shooter energy with a sci-fi setting and light roguelite structure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Missions</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mission is a short run with its own score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completed mission scores add to your Overall Score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the next mission, or replay to improve your result.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress saves after each mission you complete.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enemies</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Runner</strong> - fast, light hits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tank</strong> - slow, heavy hits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shooter</strong> - keeps distance and fires.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Phantom</strong> - subtle and hard to see.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weapons</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pistol</strong> - Low damage, limited ammo. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Automatic Rifle</strong> - Standard damage with recoil and spread. Ammo refills when low.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Laser Gun</strong> - Standard damage with infinite energy and no recoil, but overheats if overused.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gravity Gun</strong> - Standard damage with infinite energy and no recoil, but speeds up the fight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Annihilator</strong> - Close-range panic button with a short recharge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chem Gun</strong> - Poisons enemies. Kills trigger after enough enemies are poisoned.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freeze Gun</strong> - Area control tool that locks enemies in place. Slow recharge.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Difficulty Levels</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy</strong> - Relaxed and forgiving. Learn the systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Medium</strong> - The intended experience. Balance and precision matter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hard</strong> - Deadlier enemies. Tight resources. Highest multipliers.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Score</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Overall Score is ranked on two leaderboards: monthly and all-time.<br>Top monthly players are added to the Hall of Fame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Score higher by:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Headshots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot fireballs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Knock enemies off the map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the gravity gun at high speed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the pistol</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid powerful weapons (chem gun, freeze gun, annihilator)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play higher missions and harder difficulty levels</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Just Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Have fun. Shoot more. Score higher.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alien Grounds is a fast sci-fi action FPS built around arena shooter combat against relentless enemy hordes - a clean, high-speed loop of short runs, escalating pressure, and mastery. It blends boomer shooter energy with a sci-fi setting and light roguelite structure.</p>